<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<LanguageData>

  <!-- Ability labels stay lowercase, following Royalty's pt-BR ability labels ("pulso cegante",
       "terremoto neural", "pulso desequilibrador") rather than Odyssey's Title Case ones - our
       English labels are lowercase and Royalty matches that. Descriptions are third-person
       indicative, following Odyssey's own weapon-trait abilities ("Emite uma onda de energia
       eletromagnética centrado no usuário.") - EMPPulse is the def Earthshake is shaped after, so it
       is the register to match. "usuário" is Odyssey's own word for the wielder.

       "earthshake" is "tremor de terra", not "terremoto": Royalty already spends "terremoto" on
       Neuroquake, and English deliberately avoids "earthquake" too. "onda de choque" is Core's
       shockwave (RulePacks_CombatRanged "blast->onda de choque"). "rallying cry" has no vanilla
       pt-BR anchor at all, so "grito de guerra" is coined - it is the idiomatic pt-BR rendering of
       the phrase, and it recurs in UMW_Rallied's description.

       English's semicolon in the earthshake description is reflowed into its own sentence rather
       than kept: the pt-BR corpus takes no space before ";", and two sentences read better here. -->

  <!-- EN: earthshake -->
  <UMW_Earthshake.label>tremor de terra</UMW_Earthshake.label>

  <!-- EN: Slam the weapon's full mass into the ground, sending a stunning shockwave out through the earth. The shock passes under walls and stuns friend and foe alike; only the braced wielder keeps their footing. -->
  <UMW_Earthshake.description>Golpeia o chão com toda a massa da arma, lançando uma onda de choque atordoante através da terra. O abalo passa por baixo das paredes e atordoa todos, sejam amigos ou inimigos. Só o usuário, firmemente escorado, permanece de pé.</UMW_Earthshake.description>

  <!-- EN: rallying cry -->
  <UMW_RallyingCry.label>grito de guerra</UMW_RallyingCry.label>

  <!-- EN: Raise the weapon high and shout. Allies who see it are steeled, and for a time wounds barely slow them. -->
  <UMW_RallyingCry.description>Ergue a arma bem alto e solta um grito. Os aliados que a veem se enchem de coragem e, por um tempo, as feridas quase não os freiam.</UMW_RallyingCry.description>

</LanguageData>
